		<h1 class="largetext">Rodcetnife.org Forums</h1>
		<h2 class="normaltext">General Category => Rodcet Nife Guilds => Topic started by: Kinladar on April 29, 2004, 10:03:58 am</h2>

		<table width="90%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
