					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Fires of Time accepting Elemental+ Apps</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Kinladar</b> on <b>April 29, 2004, 10:03:58 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Fires of Time recently closed applications for unflagged applicants, but there is still time for motivated people who have Elemental Flags to join our Guild.<br /><br />Fires of Time focus at the moment is Time, and once reflaging for Time is finished, to push forward in a concerted effort into Gates of Discord. <br /><br />At the present time, we are accepting applications from people who are Elemental and beyond flagged. To that end, applicants who are Elemental level at the time they reach initiate status are granted a 30 DKP bonus. Applicants who are Time flaged when they reach Initiate status will receive an an additional 20 DKP bonus. This would be a net bonus of 50DKP for a Elemental/Time Flaged Applicant once they reach initiate status.<br /><br />We are commited to seeing the top end content that Everquest has to offer, and to push ourselves to achieve those goals. If you are considering a change in your EQ future, go to the  Fires of Time Website (http://www.fotguild.com) and fill out an application, or contact Rakzum, Thors or Shamllyn in game for more details.</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
